  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">MPESB Nursing Officer / Sister Tutor Answer Key 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-05-18T20:08:24+05:30\">May 18, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">8:08 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://esb.mp.gov.in/\">Madhya Pradesh Employees Selection Board (MPESB)</a></strong>&nbsp;has released the<strong> Answer Key</strong>&nbsp;on the <strong>official website</strong> for the recruitment of <strong>Nursing Officer / Sister Tutor</strong> <strong>Posts.</strong> The <strong>exam</strong> was conducted on <strong>15 May 2026</strong>. The&nbsp;<strong>MPESB</strong> application process&nbsp;started on&nbsp;<strong>06 April 2026,</strong> and candidates were able to submit their form until <strong>20 April 2026.</strong> Candidates can check their&nbsp;<strong>Answer Key</strong>&nbsp;using their&nbsp;<strong>Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the <strong>portal.</strong> The <strong>direct link</strong> is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">MPESB Nursing Officer / Sister Tutor Answer Key 2026 – Out</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">MPESB Nursing Officer / Sister Tutor Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/mpesb-nursing-officer-sister-tutor-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online Start Date : <strong>06 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online Last Date : <strong>20 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date Pay Exam Fee : <strong>20 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Date : <strong>25 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For Re-Open :<strong> 29 April – 03 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : 15 May 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"> <strong>08 May 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Declared Date : <strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">General/ Other State : <strong>₹ </strong><strong>500/-&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SC / ST / OBC : <strong>₹ </strong><strong>250/-&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">EWS / PH (Divyang)&nbsp;<strong>: ₹ 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Charge<strong> : ₹ 20/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Portal Charges Extra</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">MPESB Nursing Officer / Sister Tutor Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On 01 January 2026</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For Minimum Age : <strong>40 Years For (UR/ EWS)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For Maximum Age : <strong>45 Years For (OBC/ SC/ ST/ PH/ Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>MPESB</strong> provides age relaxation for the <strong>Nursing Officer / Sister Tutor&nbsp;position</strong> as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">2317 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">MPESB Nursing Officer / Sister Tutor Online Form 2026 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Nursing Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2099</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Sister&nbsp;Tutor</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">218</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.9632%; height: 105px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 18.5629%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 81.2384%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 18.5629%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Nursing Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 81.2384%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"94\">10+2 (Intermediate) with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB)</strong>. They should have completed either a <strong data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"156\">4-year B.Sc. Nursing</strong> course or <strong data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"220\">GNM followed by a 2-year Post Basic B.Sc. Nursing</strong> from a recognized institute approved by the <strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"338\">Madhya Pradesh Nursing Registration Council or Indian Nursing Council</strong>. Candidates must have at least <strong data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"383\">45% marks</strong> (40% for SC/ST/OBC with 5% relaxation) and must also have a <strong data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"518\">valid registration with the Madhya Pradesh Nurses Registration Council</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 18.5629%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Sister&nbsp;Tutor</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 81.2384%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"79\">10+2 with Physics, Chemistry, and Biology (PCB)</strong>. They should have completed <strong data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"153\">B.Sc. Nursing or Post Basic B.Sc. Nursing</strong> from a recognized institute. Additionally, candidates must have at least <strong data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"256\">1 year of work experience</strong> after completing their nursing degree.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check : </span><a href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/mpesb-group-4-recruitment-2025/\">MPESB Teacher Recruitment 2025</a><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><br>\n</span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download MPESB Nursing Officer / Sister Tutor Admit Card 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"1s5vvd2\" data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"167\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the official website of <strong data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"165\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Madhya Pradesh Employees Selection Board</span></span> (MPESB)</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qisnpr\" data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"222\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Go to the <strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"196\">“Admit Card”</strong> section on the homepage</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"9c282s\" data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"293\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on <strong data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"286\">“Nursing Officer / Sister Tutor Admit Card 2026”</strong> link</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6l7zzn\" data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"500\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enter the required details:</span>\n<ul data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"500\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1catb75\" data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"377\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Application Number</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pshzv4\" data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"397\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Date of Birth</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"py3pzn\" data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"481\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">First 2 letters of Mother’s Name + Last 4 digits of Aadhaar Number (if asked)</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1tbsgx5\" data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"500\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Captcha Code</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1u24xid\" data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"530\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on <strong data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"530\">Search / Login</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1uunqd\" data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"609\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Your admit card will appear on the screen</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"p9dinm\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"641\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Check all details carefully</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gvichf\" data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"667\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on <strong data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"665\">Download</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4j2w4\" data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"689\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Save the PDF file</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"aycn7h\" data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"735\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Take a clear printout for the examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;MPESB Nursing Officer / Sister Tutor Online Form 2026 : Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Online Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Medical Examination&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our Telegram Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download Answer Key</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://nursi2026.cbtexam.in/Home/ListofExam.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download Admit Card</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://esb.mp.gov.in/tacs/tac_2026/Nursing_sister_TAC26/default_tac.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Apply Online</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://esb.mponline.gov.in/Portal/Examinations/Vyapam/examsList.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Check Form Re-Open Notice</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://esb.mp.gov.in/Advertisement/ADV_2026/Nursing_Officer_Sister_Tutor_2026_form_reopen_notice_28042026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Official Notification</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://esb.mp.gov.in/Rulebooks/RB_2026/Health_Nursing_2026RuleBook02_04_2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>MPESB Official Website</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://esb.mp.gov.in/e_default.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;MPESB Nursing Officer / Sister Tutor Admit Card 2026 : Important Question&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> When will the <strong>admit card be released?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"> The admit card is released<strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"199\">&nbsp;before the examination</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Where can I download the <strong>admit card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> You can download it from the official <strong data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"417\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Madhya Pradesh Employees Selection Board</span></span> (MPESB)</strong> website</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</t